*> PURPOSE : SHIPPING CHARGES RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 987
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0017.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY SHP0017C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-FSH             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> SHIPPING CHARGE
    05 F-AM               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    *> DELIVERY SURCHARGE
    05 SG-AMT             PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM FREE-SHIPPING
    PERFORM ZONE-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "WS-FSH=" WS-FSH
    DISPLAY "F-AM=" F-AM
    DISPLAY "SG-AMT=" SG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
FREE-SHIPPING.
    *> FREE STANDARD SHIPPING
    IF WS-ORDV >= 75 AND SVC-STANDARD
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-FSH
        MOVE 0 TO F-AM
    END-IF.
ZONE-SURCHARGE.
    *> REMOTE ZONE SURCHARGE
    IF ZONE-Z7-OR-ZR
        MOVE 15 TO SG-AMT
    END-IF.
